 We use cookies to ensure the website functions properly and to improve your experience.
 <a href="/legals#cookie-policy" class="hover:underline">Learn more</a>
 </div>
 <div class="flex gap-2">
 <button id="cookie-accept"
 class="px-4 py-2 bg-level-expert hover:bg-level-expert-dark text-sm font-medium rounded-md">
 Accept All
 </button>
 <button id="cookie-essential"
 class="px-4 py-2 bg-learning-app-design-4 hover:bg-learning-app-design-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md">
 Essential Only
 </button>
 </div>
